[{"client_msg_id":"7433a888-04b4-4bc2-be5a-444f87acd255","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"そういえばMastodonもあったなぁ…結局定着すらしなかったけど。","ts":"1629125753.129300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jES"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bdba77be-b5e9-43ea-948d-acb513df5a14","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"まあ人によるんでしょうね。SNS疲れ起こしたのならサッサと離れるのも手です。","ts":"1629125390.128400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UDDCM376D","U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vw0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fca96213-3595-4781-9e83-96b4874d5351","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"なんやかんやで独り言垂れ流す場所として丁度いいんですよね、たまに反応もらえますし","ts":"1629125107.126300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uVELU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08e5993e-2abe-4bb3-a925-976d44059562","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"だいたい一年半ぐらい離れていますけど、無駄にストレス溜まらなくなったので良かったのかなと、その代わりHacker newsの日本語訳Botをいちいちアクセスしないと見れなくなったりしてますが。","ts":"1629125060.125900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AVB5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"adfce23b-7398-416c-8f0a-f67e2e87c71e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"言葉遊びと:shit: が流れてくる","ts":"1629125052.125600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BzX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"923D12C9-A7CE-4C77-8A15-217979F7C142","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"保守派なのでRTもリストも使ってなくて、「腹痛い」とか「〜食いたい」みたいなことを吐き捨てるくらいしかしなくなりました\nあと基本的にprivate","ts":"1629125040.125000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IhF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"899B6C91-E03F-4BFC-A423-7659D7B73AB7","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"Twitter有益情報流れてくるので、使ってるってのもある","